rder-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           关于娜玲珑产区\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          娜玲珑省位于哥伦比亚西南部，与厄瓜多尔接壤。这里的咖啡种植在平均海拔2,200米的高度，使其成为世界上种植海拔最高的咖啡产区之一。在如此高的海拔地区生产咖啡一般来说非常困难，但娜玲珑靠近赤道线和火山周围的陡峭山丘，为阳光照射提供了绝佳的角度，为咖啡作物的生长创造了合适的微气候。高海拔的种植加上昼夜大温差，使咖啡果实的成熟和发育进行得非常缓慢，为糖分在果实中的积累提供了时间，从而形成了该地区非常独特、甜美和复杂的咖啡风味特点。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXHfHcicvxiaAOKXEFeEzicJsjicf1TwDdBXBsKcV0TDfq2baNDYUdbW6ian69XPCkZ9WPpzSOhdibz8xQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          至今，娜玲珑大部分种植者的潜力仍未被开发。娜玲珑有约四万的咖啡生产者，其中的大多数都非常小（平均每个种植面积不到2公顷），而且通常像庞贝这样的小型生产商一样，所处的地理位置非常偏远，交通不便。诸如此类因素，再加上该地区持续的种族冲突问题，阻碍了对咖啡资源的开发，并使咖啡买家难以触及这些优质咖啡资源；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          不幸的是，咖啡并不是唯一适合娜玲珑地区生长的植物。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          罂粟（用于制造毒品）在这里也有成规模的种植，这使得这里成为20世纪90年代到21世纪初与毒品有关的暴力冲突的高发地区。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXHfHcicvxiaAOKXEFeEzicJs5B5WAHeva2NmMpksTic3gSTXKxL6B2ZDxIUduIRp3fQETIVtYGPY9Qg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           生产者之一\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          Mariana Garcia\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          在2010年至2012年，这种情况开始发生扭转，这在很大程度上要归功于哥伦比亚卓越杯的成功举办，它为娜玲珑的咖啡生产者带来了曙光。这一巨大的成功让该地区的许多种植者清楚地知道，他们的咖啡有潜力作为真正的精品咖啡出售，并且他们有机会获得比通过其他认证计划来的更高的溢价。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXHfHcicvxiaAOKXEFeEzicJsCMj23q5gXVOsEz3qqLxm0WP3dS6Y8wnFpqwGJlODYXrvL1POxNjPyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 12px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n           生产者之一\n          </span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 12px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n           Parmenidez Santa Cruz\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          今天，咖啡在社区发展方面发挥着重要作用，因为他们使该地区的暴力冲突不断成为历史，并建立了更可持续性的发展前景。许多咖啡生产者在90年代冲突最严重的时期抛弃了庄园，离开了该地区，但后来又回来继续他们的咖啡生涯并在这里重新开始生活。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXHfHcicvxiaAOKXEFeEzicJsxgDWlKiaq9S6ZjRvP3TJogjQxuyic0bv54gTAqE1Af4wtEphjrdTbriaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          庞贝村小农的晾晒棚架\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n           这支咖啡使用水洗方法进行加工处理。鲜果采摘后，\n          </span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n           使用小型手动或电动脱皮机将咖啡进行脱浆，然后放入发酵池中，无水发酵48小时，使表面的残留果肉失去粘性，然后用干净的冷水清洗。然后在一个三层的晒床上干燥，一般是15-18天，顶部有塑料薄膜，可以保护咖啡免受雨淋，并防止冷凝水滴回已经干燥的咖啡豆上。晾晒房两侧有可调节的薄膜以帮助空气流动，并控制温度以确保咖啡可以缓慢而均匀地干燥。当咖啡晾晒到含水率11%，带羊皮纸的咖啡豆将被送至脱壳厂进行脱壳加工，并进行出口。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 388px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
